## Title: |cFFFF00Simple Event Tracker|r
## Description: Tracks your daily Trade Bars and tells you when an event is running. /sevti = event info, /sevt = trade bar status (both accept: done, undo, history, event, pause, ui, help). /sevtsize 1-5 = label text size.
## Author: Jammet / Claude AI assisted (based on Event Tracker by |cAA00FFKelinmiriel|r)
